        "notes": "Glass shapes come from the photo beside each drink on the bar's own menu page and match the glass icons on the PDF menus; no source names a maker, so whether these are Nude's Savage range (Rémy Savage's 2020 design for Nude: Coupe, Coupetini, Pony, Water, Low, Highball) is unverified. The small stemmed Habanero glass resembles the Savage Pony, but that is a guess. Two new editions come from archived copies of the bar page: a June 2026 menu (file gone, drinks unknown) and the July 2026 list. No dated menus found between the 2021 opening and Dec 2025; the seven archived house cocktails are undated. The site's 'shiso' entry repeats Chroma's ingredients, so the PDF's Assignment line is used."
